**MANY cosmetics** that can be purchased with in-game currency. Players receive **150 currency** each day they log in, starting with 800. The Robo Shop includes hats, masks, skins, holdables, and more.\n\nFree-play takes place in a simulation run by Robo-Labs, a sort of playground for testing the 4 Robo-Lab's Robo Models, including the All-New Robo V4!\n\nTrailer by @JacobTheYeepsDude on YouTube", "short_description": "Rusty Robots: The Harvest, or Harvest for short, takes place in the distant future. Play with your friends in MANY free-play maps with MANY cosmetics to spice up your look! There are several minigames to play like the Fireball Minigame, Rising Lava, Slenderman Horror & Pacman Horror.\n\nTrailer by @JacobTheYeepsDude on YouTube"}]}, "developer_name": "Nicktender", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rustedgames/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rusted Games", "support_website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rustedgames/forms", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rustedgames", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26206835692344703"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_2013895695824853_2578414549326760596_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_